              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.17+2CH.36.18+2CH.36.19+2CH.36.20+2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kei 36:17-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe m’uai ba Yehova ubino ba Yeremia, kinde ma Nebukadnezar m’ubimo mi Babeli, ku njuru asikari pare ceke, ku thek ceke m’i ng’om ma ni the bim pare, ku kodhidhanu ceke, ubekiedo kum Yerusalem, man kum adhurane ceke, uwacu kumae: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, uwacu kumae, Cidhi, man iyer ni Zedekia m’ubimo mi Yuda, man iwac ire kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, Nen, abimio adhura maeni i cing ubimo mi Babeli, man ebiwang’e ku mac: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e ibiboth ungo kud i cinge, ento jubimeki andha, man jubimii i cinge; e weng’i bineno wang’ ubimo mi Babeli, man wubiweco wukude dhok ku dhok, e ibicidho Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento winj lembe pa Yehova, E Zedekia m’ubimo mi Yuda: Yehova wacu kumae piri, Ibitho ku palamularu ngo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ibitho i kwiocwiny; man ku wang’upiny pa kwaru, ubimo ma kwong’a m’ular uwok iri, gibitimo wang’upiny iri kumeca; e gibiywegi, ma giwacu kumae, A Rwoth! kum ayero lembe, Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
