          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno lembe pa Yehova bino ba Yeremia m’uai ba Yehova, m’uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, uwacu kumae: Atimo lembariba ku kwaruwu i ceng’ m’awodhogi ie woko kud i ng’om Misiri, kud i ot mi ng’eca, awacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 21:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 15:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kajik mi rtindi abiro kubeng’wu kubeng’wu ng’atuman bigonyo umin ma Jaebrania, ma jung’iewo i beng’i, man m’utimo iri rundi abusiel, ibigonye eai i beng’i: ento kwaruwu winjo dwanda ngo, kadok ithgi de giciko ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kawono wulokru, man wutimo gin m’atira i wang’a, kuyero pi gony ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman ni wadi; man wutimo lembariba i wang’a i ot m’ulwongre ku nyinga: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento wulokru man wucido nyinga, man ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman uketho jamiru pare dwogi, man ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman bong’ pare, m’egonyo ku yeny ma ie yenyo; e wukelogi i ng’eca, kara ubed iwu ni jumiru man ni bong’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Yehova wacu kumae: Wuwinjo dwanda ngo, ya wuyer pi gony, ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman ni umin mire, man ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman ni wadi: nen, ayero iwu pi gony, Yehova wacu, ni palamularu, ni thong’om, man ni ndru; man abiketho juthorowu kun ku kun i kind ker ceke m’i ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abimio dhanu ma gikadhu ku wi lembariba para, m’utimo lembe mi lembariba ma gitimo i wang’a ungo, kinde ma gikaku i nyathi dhiang’ ma gikadhu de kud i kind wathne; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en e judongomawijo mi Yuda, ku judongomawijo mi Yerusalem, man ju mugumba, ku julam, ku dhanu ceke m’i ng’om, ma gikadhu i kind wath nyathi dhiange: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abimiogi cil i cing’ judegi migi, man i cing’ ju m’uyenyo kwo migi; e avujgi bibedo ni cemo mi winyo ma kor polo, man ni yedi m’i ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abimio Zedekia m’ubimo mi Yuda ku judongomawijo pare i cing’ judegi migi, man i cing’ ju m’uyenyo kwo migi, man i cing’ njuru asikari mir ubimo mi Babeli, m’uai kud i beng’wu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, abing’olo, Yehova wacu, man abiketho gidwogo bang’ adhura maeni; e gibikiedo i kume, gibimake de, man gibiwang’e ku mac: man abidwoko adhura mi Yuda ni uvuru, ma ng’atu moko mbe m’ubedo i ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
